SVG-edit 7.4.2 — reference distribution
=======================================

What is distributed here
------------------------
svgedit-7.4.2.tgz is the unmodified npm release of SVG-edit 7.4.2
(https://registry.npmjs.org/svgedit/-/svgedit-7.4.2.tgz,
sha256 249cc66750a5b4ac39fc79ee8723ab71b581c48946aaea1ee58054fd91db98a7).
Homepage and source repository: https://github.com/SVG-Edit/svgedit

The archive contains the built editor (package/dist/editor), its complete
source (package/src, package/packages/svgcanvas) and source maps whose
sourcesContent carries the original source of every bundled module listed
below. server.py and start.sh are task-authored: they serve the files of
package/dist/editor unchanged from the archive; no product file is modified.

